      <description>&lt;h3&gt;A new look, and fewer places to look&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Also on iPhone&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Transcripts have the new look: serif text, colored speaker chips, and a glass player.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The recorder has the new look: the kind in serif and a persimmon clock.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Minimized, a recording shows its time with Pause and Stop above the tab bar.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/stumpandroot/verbose-updates/releases/tag/beta-242"&gt;Release notes on GitHub&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
